WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.838
You can start on a side path or take a full jump.

00:00:03.838 --> 00:00:04.797
Both are valid.

00:00:04.797 --> 00:00:07.355
The constraint is hours and risk, not identity.

00:00:07.355 --> 00:00:10.234
This lesson is about side path vs full jump.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:11.833
Keep survival money; time budgets.

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:14.071
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:14.071 --> 00:00:17.269
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:17.269 --> 00:00:22.066
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:25.584
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:25.904 --> 00:00:28.379
Keep survival money if risk is high.

00:00:28.379 --> 00:00:31.561
Do not quit a paycheck for a fantasy schedule.

00:00:31.561 --> 00:00:34.743
Remember the objective: choose a realistic weekly hour budget.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:38.633
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:42.876
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.765
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:00:46.765 --> 00:00:51.008
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:00:51.328 --> 00:00:55.200
Pick a weekly hour budget you can keep for thirty days.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.368
Five to ten honest hours is enough to learn.

00:00:58.368 --> 00:01:01.536
Remember the objective: choose a realistic weekly hour budget.

00:01:01.536 --> 00:01:05.408
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:01:05.408 --> 00:01:09.632
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:01:09.632 --> 00:01:13.504
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:01:13.504 --> 00:01:17.728
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:20.247
Zero hours is not a plan.

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:23.546
A realistic budget beats an inspiring one you abandon.

00:01:23.546 --> 00:01:26.844
